dout.log` files — leave them alone.\n\nLet me also check opencode.json to see if there's any test/lint command configured.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_058db9b99001oqpqDXPfgsBeZm","sessionID":"ses_fa72784baffe7hGdb4Yocbua9K","messageID":"msg_058d9029e001As5Mz6dpCykMW4"}}
